  "notes": {
    "raw": "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 9 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 5. 4 1 2 + 4. 3 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 5 5 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 5. 4 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 2. 1 9 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 5 5 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 4. 9 7 8 \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 9 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 2 8. 4 6 1 + 1. 5 9 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 7 5 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 2 7. 2 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ & \\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 2 8. 4 6 1 - 1. 5 9 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} - 0. 7 5 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 1 3. 6 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 5 4. 0 9 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\end{array}\n$$\nSources: Enthalpy of formation at 298 K from Mills (80). Low-temperature heat capacities and entropy at 298 K from Beyer (8). High-temperature data based on Mraw (83). ",
